{"seq":2,"slug":"grid-based","title":"网格法：Stam 稳定流体与欧拉视角的翻涌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-fluid-simulation/volume/grid-based","wordCount":1844,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"网格法-stam-稳定流体与欧拉视角的翻涌\">网格法：Stam 稳定流体与欧拉视角的翻涌</h1><p>2003 年 Jos Stam 在《Real-Time Fluid Dynamics for Games》里干了一件让整个行业松一口气的事：他给出一套无论时间步多大都不会「炸」的流体求解流程。在此之前，欧拉网格法一直被<a href=\"../foundations/why-fluid-hard\">非线性对流的不稳定</a>折磨——显式积分动辄溢出成 NaN。Stam 的稳定流体（Stable Fluids）用一个反直觉的技巧根治了它，从此欧拉法成为游戏里烟、雾、火以及封闭水域翻涌的主力框架。这一篇讲清 MAC 网格、平流-扩散-投影三步、压力泊松方程怎么解，以及 FLIP 这类混合法如何补齐纯网格的短板——与<a href=\"sph-particles\">SPH 粒子法</a>构成欧拉/拉格朗日的完整对照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把流体量存在固定网格上\">核心概念：把流体量存在固定网格上</h2><p>欧拉法把空间切成规则网格，让流体「流过」这些固定单元。存储上最常用 <strong>MAC 网格（Marker-and-Cell，交错网格）</strong>：标量（压力、密度）存在格子中心，速度分量存在格子的面上——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 存左右面、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 存上下面。这种交错不是强迫症，而是让散度、梯度这些差分算子恰好定义在正确位置、避免棋盘格数值震荡的关键。整个求解每帧把速度场推进一个时间步，分解成四个依次施加的子步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>Project</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mtext>Diffuse</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>Advect</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{u}^{n+1} = \\text{Project}\\Big(\\text{Diffuse}\\big(\\text{Advect}(\\vec{u}^n)\\big) + \\Delta t\\,\\vec{f}\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.