yle=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因为新值是旧场里某处值的插值，永远不会超过旧场的极值范围——这在数学上保证了无条件稳定，时间步再大也不炸。代价是插值带来<strong>数值耗散</strong>：细节被反复平均掉，烟雾涡旋会莫名变糊、能量凭空流失。缓解手段有涡量约束（vorticity confinement，人为把丢失的涡旋补回去）、BFECC/MacCormack 高阶回溯等。这个「稳定但耗散」的取舍，正是欧拉法最鲜明的性格，也和<a href=\"../foundations/plausible-vs-accurate\">可信优先</a>的立场契合——宁可糊一点，绝不崩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投影-又见压力泊松方程\">投影：又见压力泊松方程</h2><p>平流加外力后得到的速度场几乎必然有散度（违反不可压），投影这一步负责把它「抹平」。做法是找一个压力场 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，让减去其梯度后的速度恰好无散度——这归结为在网格上解<a href=\"../foundations/why-fluid-hard\">压力泊松方程</a>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla^2 p = \\frac{\\rho}{\\Delta t}\\nabla\\cdot\\vec{u}^*,\\qquad \\vec{u}^{n+1}=\\vec{u}^*-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\rho}\\nabla p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.822em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是整个求解最贵的一步，因为泊松方程是全局耦合的（一处改动全场响应）。数值上它变成一个大型稀疏线性系统，解法按性价比排：<strong>Jacobi/Gauss-Seidel 迭代</strong>最简单、GPU 友好但收敛慢；<strong>共轭梯度（CG）</strong> 收敛快但实现复杂；<strong>多重网格（multigrid）</strong> 对大网格最优但工程量大。游戏里为了实时，常常故意只迭代很少几步（欠收敛），换来的轻微可压缩性在视觉上可接受——又一次拿精度换预算。求解器的这些迭代成本，是<a href=\"../practice/fluid-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>里性能预算的大头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flip-与混合法-补上纯网格的短板\">FLIP 与混合法：补上纯网格的短板</h2><p>纯欧拉网格有两个硬伤：平流耗散让它「太黏、丢细节」，且它不擅长追踪自由液面（网格不知道哪里是水）。<strong>FLIP（Fluid-Implicit-Particle）</strong> 及其现代改良 <strong>APIC</strong> 用「粒子 + 背景网格」的混合把两家的长处缝在一起：用粒子携带速度（避免平流耗散、天然追踪液面），用背景网格解压力投影（高效维持不可压）。每帧在两者间来回转移——粒子速度插到网格、网格解投影、再把速度变化插回粒子。</p>\n<p>据 2025 年的 WebGPU 流体实现总结（如 Codrops 上的 WebGPU 流体渲染文章与开源 PIC/FLIP 项目），PIC/FLIP 网格求解器现在能整个跑在 GPU compute shader 里，用并行前缀和处理粒子-网格转移，实时模拟数万粒子的液体。FLIP 是电影级液体（水花四溅的真水）的主流选择，也越来越多进入高端游戏。它本质上站在<a href=\"../foundations/fluid-taxonomy\">方法谱系</a>那张欧拉-拉格朗日分岔图的正中间——这也是为什么它既在这一篇（网格投影）也牵连<a href=\"sph-particles\">SPH 粒子法</a>（粒子表示）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用边界-封闭翻涌称王-开放大水让贤\">适用边界：封闭翻涌称王，开放大水让贤</h2><p>网格法的甜区是<strong>有限体积内的连续翻涌</strong>：一池会漩涡的水、锅里翻滚的液体、以及烟火雾这类体积介质（把密度/温度当被平流的标量场即可）。它的不可压约束处理得比 SPH 干净，光滑连续流动比粒子法自然。</p>\n<p>但它有明确边界。其一，成本随维度暴涨——三维网格的内存和压力求解都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，想要大范围高分辨率几乎不可能，所以它做不了开放海洋（那是<a href=\"../surface/fft-ocean\">FFT 海洋</a>的地盘）。其二，纯网格对飞溅、细水花不友好（自由液面追踪吃力），这块要靠 FLIP 或 SPH 补。其三，网格是轴对齐的，动边界（如运动的船体在网格里搅水）处理起来比粒子法别扭。所以实战选型很清晰：<strong>封闭、连续、要漩涡 → 网格/FLIP；开放大海面 → 高度场；强飞溅交互 → SPH</strong>，这张对照会在<a href=\"../practice/fluid-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>收拢成完整决策表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网格法（欧拉）把流体量存在固定的 MAC 交错网格上，每帧按「外力→平流→扩散→投影」四步推进速度场。</li>\n<li>Stam 稳定流体的关键是半拉格朗日回溯平流：用旧场插值保证无条件稳定，代价是数值耗散（用涡量约束等缓解）。</li>\n<li>投影步解压力泊松方程维持不可压，是最贵的一步，游戏常用少步迭代（Jacobi/CG/多重网格）欠收敛换实时。</li>\n<li>FLIP/APIC 混合法用「粒子携速 + 网格投影」缝合两家长处，是电影级真水主流，2025 年已可全 GPU 跑数万粒子。</li>\n<li>甜区是封闭连续翻涌与烟雾；开放大海面让给高度场，强飞溅让给 SPH。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>拉格朗日对照阵营：<a href=\"sph-particles\">SPH 粒子法</a></li>\n<li>高度场折中方案：<a href=\"shallow-water\">浅水方程</a></li>\n<li>稳定性与压力泊松的物理根源：<a href=\"../foundations/why-fluid-hard\">为何流体模拟难</a></li>\n<li>求解器的性能预算：<a href=\"../practice/fluid-in-practice\">落地与边界</a></li>\n<li>引擎里的流体求解对照（跨库）：<a href=\"../../game-physics/fluid-and-softbody/fluid-simulation\">02_game-physics 流体模拟</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网格法：Stam 稳定流体与欧拉视角的翻涌","id":"网格法-stam-稳定流体与欧拉视角的翻涌"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把流体量存在固定网格上","id":"核心概念-把流体量存在固定网格上"},{"level":2,"text":"半拉格朗日平流：Stam 的稳定魔法","id":"半拉格朗日平流-stam-的稳定魔法"},{"level":2,"text":"投影：又见压力泊松方程","id":"投影-又见压力泊松方程"},{"level":2,"text":"FLIP 与混合法：补上纯网格的短板","id":"flip-与混合法-补上纯网格的短板"},{"level":2,"text":"适用边界：封闭翻涌称王，开放大水让贤","id":"适用边界-封闭翻涌称王-开放大水让贤"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"SPH 粒子法：把水拆成一群会算密度的粒子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-fluid-simulation/volume/sph-particles"},"next":{"title":"浅水方程：介于高度场与体积之间的务实中间地带","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-fluid-simulation/volume/shallow-water"}}